{
 "title": "Five blocks",
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "Five blocks",
   "card": false,
   "beats": [
    {
     "id": "c495",
     "shot": "fb_king",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "1954.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c496",
     "shot": "fb_king",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "A young preacher arrives to lead a small",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c497",
     "shot": "fb_king",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "brick church on Dexter Avenue, one block down",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c498",
     "shot": "fb_king",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "the hill from the Capitol.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c499",
     "shot": "fb_king",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "He is 25 years old.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c500",
     "shot": "fb_king",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "His name is Martin Luther King Jr. In",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:King",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c501",
     "shot": "fb_bus",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Montgomery, the city buses had a rule.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c502",
     "shot": "fb_bus",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Black passengers paid at the front, got off,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c503",
     "shot": "fb_bus",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "walked around, and got back on at the",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c504",
     "shot": "fb_bus",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "back door.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c505",
     "shot": "fb_bus",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "And if a white passenger needed a seat,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c506",
     "shot": "fb_bus",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "a Black passenger had to stand.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c507",
     "shot": "fb_bus",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "In March 1955, a 15-year-old girl",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c508",
     "shot": "fb_bus",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "named Claudette Colvin refused to give up her",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c509",
     "shot": "fb_bus",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "seat.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c510",
     "shot": "fb_bus",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "She was arrested.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "thud",
       "w:arrested.",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c511",
     "shot": "fb_parks",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Nine months later, on December 1st, a seamstress",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c512",
     "shot": "fb_parks",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "finished work at a department store and walked",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c513",
     "shot": "fb_parks",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "to the bus stop, right at the bottom",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c514",
     "shot": "fb_parks",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "of our five blocks, on Court Square, where people",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c515",
     "shot": "fb_parks",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "had once been sold.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c516",
     "shot": "fb_parks",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Her name was Rosa Parks.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:Parks.",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c517",
     "shot": "fb_parks",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "When the driver told her to stand up,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c518",
     "shot": "fb_parks",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "she said, no.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:no.",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c519",
     "shot": "fb_boycott",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Four days later, Black Montgomery stopped riding the",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c520",
     "shot": "fb_boycott",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "buses.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c521",
     "shot": "fb_boycott",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "People walked to work, miles, every day, in",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c522",
     "shot": "fb_boycott",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "the rain.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c523",
     "shot": "fb_boycott",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "They organized carpools.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c524",
     "shot": "fb_boycott",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And the boycott was planned in that little",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c525",
     "shot": "fb_boycott",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "church on Dexter Avenue, with a 26-year-old",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c526",
     "shot": "fb_boycott",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Dr. King as its leader.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c527",
     "shot": "fb_boycott",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "They kept it up for 381 days.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ticks",
       "w:381",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c528",
     "shot": "fb_boycott",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And in the end, the Supreme Court ruled",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c529",
     "shot": "fb_boycott",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "that Montgomery's segregated buses were against the Constitution.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:Constitution.",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c530",
     "shot": "fb_wallace",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The bus boycott was only the first round.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c531",
     "shot": "fb_wallace",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "In 1963, Alabama's new governor, George Wallace, stood",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c532",
     "shot": "fb_wallace",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "on the Capitol steps, on the same spot",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c533",
     "shot": "fb_wallace",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "where Jefferson Davis had been sworn in, and",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c534",
     "shot": "fb_wallace",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "promised, quote, segregation forever.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:forever.",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c535",
     "shot": "fb_wallace",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "That summer, he stood in a doorway at",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c536",
     "shot": "fb_wallace",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "the University of Alabama to block two Black",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c537",
     "shot": "fb_wallace",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "students from enrolling.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c538",
     "shot": "fb_wallace",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "He stepped aside that same day.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c539",
     "shot": "fb_children",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "In Birmingham, thousands of children, some still in",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c540",
     "shot": "fb_children",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "grade school, marched for their rights.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c541",
     "shot": "fb_children",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "The police met them with dogs and fire",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c542",
     "shot": "fb_children",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "hoses.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c543",
     "shot": "fb_children",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "The pictures went around the world.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c544",
     "shot": "fb_church",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "September 15, 1963.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c545",
     "shot": "fb_church",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "A Sunday morning in Birmingham.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c546",
     "shot": "fb_church",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "A bomb, planted by Ku Klux Klan members,",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c547",
     "shot": "fb_church",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "exploded at the 16th Street Baptist Church.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c548",
     "shot": "fb_church",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Four girls were killed.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c549",
     "shot": "fb_church",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Addie Mae Collins, Carole Robertson, Cynthia Wesley, Denise",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c550",
     "shot": "fb_church",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "McNair.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c551",
     "shot": "fb_church",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Denise was 11.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c552",
     "shot": "fb_church",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "The others were 14.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c553",
     "shot": "fb_selma",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Then came Selma.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c554",
     "shot": "fb_selma",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "In Dallas County, around Selma, more than half",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c555",
     "shot": "fb_selma",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "the people were Black, but only about two",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c556",
     "shot": "fb_selma",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "out of every hundred eligible Black voters were",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c557",
     "shot": "fb_selma",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "registered.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c558",
     "shot": "fb_selma",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Every time people lined up at the courthouse",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c559",
     "shot": "fb_selma",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "to register, they were turned away, or arrested.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c560",
     "shot": "fb_selma",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "So they decided to march, 54 miles, from",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "whoosh",
       "w:54",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c561",
     "shot": "fb_selma",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Selma all the way to Montgomery, to the",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c562",
     "shot": "fb_selma",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Capitol, to the top of our five blocks.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c563",
     "shot": "fb_bridge",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Sunday, March 7, 1965.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c564",
     "shot": "fb_bridge",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "About 600 marchers walk out of Selma, two",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c565",
     "shot": "fb_bridge",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "by two, and climb the Edmund Pettus Bridge.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c566",
     "shot": "fb_bridge",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "At the bottom, state troopers are waiting.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c567",
     "shot": "fb_bridge",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "The troopers charge with clubs and tear gas.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c568",
     "shot": "fb_bridge",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "A young organizer named John Lewis has his",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c569",
     "shot": "fb_bridge",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "skull fractured.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c570",
     "shot": "fb_bridge",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "That night, the whole country saw it on",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c571",
     "shot": "fb_bridge",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "television.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c572",
     "shot": "fb_bridge",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "It became known as Bloody Sunday.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c573",
     "shot": "fb_march",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Two weeks later, they tried again, this time",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c574",
     "shot": "fb_march",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "protected by federal troops.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c575",
     "shot": "fb_march",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Five days, 54 miles.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c576",
     "shot": "fb_march",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "They slept in fields along the highway.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c577",
     "shot": "fb_up",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And on March 25, around 25,000 people",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c578",
     "shot": "fb_up",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "marched up Dexter Avenue, past the fountain where",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "tick",
       "w:fountain",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c579",
     "shot": "fb_up",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "people were once sold, past the bus stop",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "tick",
       "w:bus",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c580",
     "shot": "fb_up",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "where Rosa Parks said no, past Dr. King's",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c581",
     "shot": "fb_up",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "church, up the hill to the steps where",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "tick",
       "w:church,",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c582",
     "shot": "fb_up",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "the Confederacy was born.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:Confederacy",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c583",
     "shot": "fb_up",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "That August, the president signed the Voting Rights",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:Voting",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c584",
     "shot": "fb_up",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Act.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c585",
     "shot": "fb_answer",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Five blocks.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c586",
     "shot": "fb_answer",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Slavery at the bottom, the Confederacy at the",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c587",
     "shot": "fb_answer",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "top.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c588",
     "shot": "fb_answer",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And a hundred years later, the people the",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c589",
     "shot": "fb_answer",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Confederacy was built to keep down walked up",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c590",
     "shot": "fb_answer",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "those same five blocks and took the steps.",
     "date": null
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}